{
  "app_id": 582160,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "A COUNTRY TO DISCOVER From deserts to lush oases, from the Mediterranean Sea to the tombs of Giza, sail down the Nile, and fight your way against dangerous ancient factions and wild beasts as you explore this gigantic and unpredictable land. EMBRACE ACTION-RPG Experience a completely new way to fight. Loot and use dozens of weapons with different characteristics and rarities. Explore deep progression mechanics and challenge your skills against unique and powerful bosses. A NEW STORY EVERY TIME YOU PLAY Engage in multiple quests and gripping stories as you cross paths with strong and memorable characters, from the wealthiest high-born to the most desperate outcasts.",
    "zh-Hant": "等待探索的國度 從沙漠到蔥鬱綠洲、從地中海到吉薩大金字塔，沿著尼羅河航行，在你對抗古老派系與野獸同時，探索這片廣闊又變幻莫測的大地。 擁抱動作 RPG 體驗全新的戰鬥方式。掠奪數百種武器來使用，每種都有不同的特性與稀有度。深度探索進度機制，挑戰自己的技能，對抗強大特殊的頭目。 每次遊玩都是新的故事 遇見英勇難忘的角色，從最富有的貴族出身，到最絕望的遭放逐者，參與多項任務和動人故事。",
    "zh-Hans": "广袤国度，等你探索 从沙漠到绿洲，从地中海到吉萨古墓，沿着尼罗河顺流而下，战胜危险的远古势力、凶猛野兽，探索这片广阔无垠又充满未知的大地。 为角色扮演增添动作玩法 体验全新的战斗方式。搜刮、使用数十种不同稀有度和属性的武器。探索深度成长系统，通过独特的强大头目来考验你的本领。 每次游玩都有新的故事 从富贵名流到落魄流浪者，结交个性分明的角色，体验丰富多彩的任务与扣人心弦的故事。",
    "ja": "発見に満ちた大地 砂漠から緑豊かなオアシス、地中海からギザの墓所まで、ナイル川を下り、危険な古代の勢力や野生の猛獣と戦いながら、この広大で予測不能な大地を探索しよう。 進化したアクションRPG まったく新しい戦闘システムを体感しよう。さまざまな特性やレアリティを持つ数十種類の武器を手に入れよう。奥深い成長システムを極め、アビリティを駆使して唯一無二の強敵に挑め。 プレイするたびに新たな物語が紡がれる 華やかな上流貴族から絶望の果てを生きる者まで、印象的な登場人物たちと出会い、数々のクエストと心を揺さぶる物語を堪能しよう。",
    "ko": "탐험의 세계로 사막부터 녹음이 가득한 오아시스, 그리고 지중해부터 기자의 무덤까지. 나일강을 따라 항해하고, 거대하고 예측할 수 없는 땅을 탐험하면서 위험한 고대 세력과 야수들에 맞서 싸우세요. 액션 RPG 세계로 떠나는 모험 완전히 새로워진 전투 방식을 경험하세요. 다양한 특성과 등급을 지닌 수많은 무기를 약탈하고 사용하세요. 깊이 있는 메커니즘을 탐험하고 독특하고 강력한 보스들 전투를 벌이면서 여러분의 실력을 발휘해 보세요. 플레이할 때마다 달라지는 스토리 부유한 최상위 계층부터 참담한 부랑자까지, 여러 퀘스트를 진행하면서 다양한 캐릭터들과 상호 작용하고, 그때마다 달라지는 스토리도 직접 확인해 보세요."
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
    "en": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A COUNTRY TO DISCOVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deserts to lush oases, from the Mediterranean Sea to the tombs of Giza, sail down the Nile, and fight your way against dangerous ancient factions and wild beasts as you explore this gigantic and unpredictable land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBRACE ACTION-RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a completely new way to fight. Loot and use dozens of weapons with different characteristics and rarities. Explore deep progression mechanics and challenge your skills against unique and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NEW STORY EVERY TIME YOU PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in multiple quests and gripping stories as you cross paths with strong and memorable characters, from the wealthiest high-born to the most desperate outcasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "zh-Hant": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >等待探索的國度</h2>從沙漠到蔥鬱綠洲、從地中海到吉薩大金字塔，沿著尼羅河航行，在你對抗古老派系與野獸同時，探索這片廣闊又變幻莫測的大地。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >擁抱動作 RPG</h2>體驗全新的戰鬥方式。掠奪數百種武器來使用，每種都有不同的特性與稀有度。深度探索進度機制，挑戰自己的技能，對抗強大特殊的頭目。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >每次遊玩都是新的故事</h2>遇見英勇難忘的角色，從最富有的貴族出身，到最絕望的遭放逐者，參與多項任務和動人故事。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "zh-Hans": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >广袤国度，等你探索</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从沙漠到绿洲，从地中海到吉萨古墓，沿着尼罗河顺流而下，战胜危险的远古势力、凶猛野兽，探索这片广阔无垠又充满未知的大地。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >为角色扮演增添动作玩法</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >体验全新的战斗方式。搜刮、使用数十种不同稀有度和属性的武器。探索深度成长系统，通过独特的强大头目来考验你的本领。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >每次游玩都有新的故事</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从富贵名流到落魄流浪者，结交个性分明的角色，体验丰富多彩的任务与扣人心弦的故事。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "ja": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >発見に満ちた大地</h2>砂漠から緑豊かなオアシス、地中海からギザの墓所まで、ナイル川を下り、危険な古代の勢力や野生の猛獣と戦いながら、この広大で予測不能な大地を探索しよう。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >進化したアクションRPG</h2>まったく新しい戦闘システムを体感しよう。さまざまな特性やレアリティを持つ数十種類の武器を手に入れよう。奥深い成長システムを極め、アビリティを駆使して唯一無二の強敵に挑め。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >プレイするたびに新たな物語が紡がれる</h2>華やかな上流貴族から絶望の果てを生きる者まで、印象的な登場人物たちと出会い、数々のクエストと心を揺さぶる物語を堪能しよう。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "ko": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >탐험의 세계로</h2>사막부터 녹음이 가득한 오아시스, 그리고 지중해부터 기자의 무덤까지. 나일강을 따라 항해하고, 거대하고 예측할 수 없는 땅을 탐험하면서 위험한 고대 세력과 야수들에 맞서 싸우세요.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >액션 RPG 세계로 떠나는 모험</h2>완전히 새로워진 전투 방식을 경험하세요. 다양한 특성과 등급을 지닌 수많은 무기를 약탈하고 사용하세요. 깊이 있는 메커니즘을 탐험하고 독특하고 강력한 보스들 전투를 벌이면서 여러분의 실력을 발휘해 보세요.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >플레이할 때마다 달라지는 스토리</h2>부유한 최상위 계층부터 참담한 부랑자까지, 여러 퀘스트를 진행하면서 다양한 캐릭터들과 상호 작용하고, 그때마다 달라지는 스토리도 직접 확인해 보세요.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>"
  }
}
